186 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 96 0 R/T(SoleSync is an all-in-one sneaker platform that unifies the marketplace experience with an integrated shoe maintenance and care service in a single mobile app. Designed for both serious sneakerheads and casual buyers, it owns the full sneaker lifecycle \204 discovery, purchase, maintenance, and re-engagement \204 within one continuous ecosystem. Its core differentiator is a built-in care system that turns shoe maintenance from an everyday problem into a designated service in under a minute, transforming what would otherwise be a standard shopping app into a complete sneaker lifecycle platform.)/E(SoleSync is an all-in-one sneaker platform that unifies the marketplace experience with an integrated shoe maintenance and care service in a single mobile app. Designed for both serious sneakerheads and casual buyers, it owns the full sneaker lifecycle \204 discovery, purchase, maintenance, and re-engagement \204 within one continuous ecosystem. Its core differentiator is a built-in care system that turns shoe maintenance from an everyday problem into a designated service in under a minute, transforming what would otherwise be a standard shopping app into a complete sneaker lifecycle platform.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

