465 0 obj
<</Title(Facial recognition is unreliable in practice \204 the in-class scanner frequently lags, fails to detect faces, or misidentifies students, leaving attendance unrecorded despite the student being physically present)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 463 0 R/Next 468 0 R>>
endobj

466 0 obj
<</Title(2.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 463 0 R/Prev 468 0 R/First 469 0 R/Last 470 0 R/Count -2>>
endobj

